# Allowlist: only what the image is built from enters the build context.
# .env (the token), .jk/ (the run database) and every local build output stay
# out, whatever else is added to the checkout later.
*
!pyproject.toml
!LICENSE
!uv.lock
!src/
!design/tokens.json
!web/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/src/tokens.css
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/__pycache__/
**/.DS_Store
